  At p=7: 2.4
  At p=11: 2.440

  arg(lambda_c)/pi ≈ ln(2) = 0.693147
  This connects the tribonacci transfer matrix to information theory

  THE CHEEGER-PERIODICITY PRODUCT:
  h(level d) * d → 1/p as d → infinity
  For p=2 (graphs): h*d → 1/2
  For p=3 (tournaments): h*d → 1/3
  This is the RECIPROCAL of the min_cycle!

  1024 = 2^10 in the k-periodicity tower:
    k=2: level d=511, exact for n <= 1023
    k=3: level d=340, exact for n <= 1022
    k=5: level d=204, exact for n <= 1024
    k=7: level d=145, exact for n <= 1021

  *** k=5 tower: level 204 is exact for n <= 1024 = 2^10 ***
  This connects the binary tower (powers of 2) to the 5-periodic tower!

